<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Giglage</para>
  <para style="toc2">Giglage</para>
  <para style="toc1">Giglage</para>
  <para style="mt">Giglage</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="3 crosses" file="cn01842B.tif" size="span" copy="David C Cook" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10" />Na ene kogonen erabedi na i pere edingo, moglka i, na goraglka ba ene na ta kanige etn, na kiana yoba geglkwa pai meglmara aimadi ta pai moglkrabuka. Te, na ogona gagna maugl sinaiglkwa ba maugl sinaiglmara i ta buglkrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="PSA 16:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6" />Yoba na yagl ta moglmedi kankre, taragl kide, degrme mere yegl ta moglmedi na kanigwa. Ye na ka narisre, deno kubro narikwa.<verse eid="PSA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7" />Yoba na kandre, ye mudu kiam si narsre, ka kide di narikwa. Ye bitno pia sidre, yegl digwa,<verse eid="PSA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8" />Yagl i Yawe na ake ple dinabedi pre gigle dugwa. Ana Yawe ye siragl pre ake ple dikrume? Yawe ka kaima ye wakai kaNuma, ye ake ple dugo we di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="PSA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">************************</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16" />Yoba mabuno kide beglkwa na winabo di i suna edigwa. Agl are ere mogl, taragl ere sinamnedi winabo dimere, yegl mere na winabo di i suna edigwa. Na ogona kaglna mina sigwa boglka.<verse eid="PSA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17" />Na yobuglna swara swarade kerinaglka kuno erabuka. Yoba na toro kanigwa.<verse eid="PSA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18" />Ye na kuguglna gaglna yubu sidre, ira inabedi satu sigwa.<verse eid="PSA 22:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1" />Yawe na suglna yagl moglko, na pra moglka. <verse eid="PSA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2" />Ye kugl wakai boglkwa na ame dinatnedi ersre, nigl konande moglkwa nenatnedi erukwa. <verse eid="PSA 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3" />Na kiana mina yobuglo bogl narsre, di paduglmere mere konbo du duglo boratnedi erukwa.<verse eid="PSA 23:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12" />Na kudana ikne na ere kide ere naramnedi prikwa i, ye ere kide ere naraiglmedi kanige erekro! Ye kot wagle na pre ka kibi didre, ege ege na sinamnedi keme erikwa.<verse eid="PSA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9" />Ye na kabagle giglede ta moglko, ye ere wakai ere narabedi pre gi diga. No kaya mokna akie nobuglka ba ye ere mogl, moko narsre, na ere kide ere narukwa.<verse eid="PSA 41:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41" />
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18" />Ene ede mitna ibo enga. Ene kuda ikne si kane sidre i ede engo, yoba ere mogl, taragl wakai ene gun yenatnedi teigwa. Yoba okna kanen sedigwa ama taragl wakai ene gun yenatnedi teigwa. Yegl pre erme Yawe God dumo i morabiwa.<verse eid="PSA 68:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68" />
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4" />Yoba mabuno ta paikrumara na deno kubro narikwa i, mere kide meglkwa. Na bitna yugo swara swarade keribo, namba i kunabe yenabuka. Yoba na dena kubro narikwa i keribo, namba i podo yenabuka. Yoba mabuno ta paikrumara na kudana ikne moglsre, na si goramnedi prikwa i, mere kide meglkwa. Na taraglno ta kunogl nekrika ba ye Noro ikne edo! digwa.<verse eid="PSA 69:4" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69" />
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2" />Ene muglo meglbi ere yekitnga igne ya te, dumo makan ere yekitnga igne, ene God motnga. Ene okna ibo aimadi motnga ya te, okuo ama aimadi moratnga.<verse eid="PSA 90:2" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90" />
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20" />Ene Yawe angeloma meglkwa i, ene yobuglno podo paugo, Yawe dumere ersre, ye kamo duglo beglkwa. Ana ene we, Yawe debie sidre, kagie kade teo!<verse eid="PSA 103:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21" />Ene Yawe amimo moglsre, ye kogonmo ere tedre, ye ene eraiglmedi prumere erikwa. Ene mudu Yawe debie sidre, kagie kade teo!<verse eid="PSA 103:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103" />
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19" />Ene ba ere yenga i, siragl ege yogwa, i nogugl edenabedi ere yenga. Te, ade we, benabuka egemo yogwa igne i keme beigwa.<verse eid="PSA 104:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20" />Ene mim erabedi dedingo, mim eruko, eduer yogwa. Eduer yogo, dua kabu mudu edigle wan meglkwa.<verse eid="PSA 104:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21" />Dua kabu wan meglko, laion dua kabu si nenamnedi be didre, God kiabno norabedi doko wan meglkwa.<verse eid="PSA 104:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22" />Laion wan meglko, ana ade ede mitna ugwa igne we, ye teke ede pi kobuglo mur atne pidre, ugl paigwa.<verse eid="PSA 104:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23" />Te, yoba we, ade ede mitna ugwa igne, ye ede kogono wagle pi, kogon ere wan meglko, min paugo, aglke ede ikne wigwa.<verse eid="PSA 104:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24" />Yawe yo, ene taragl kane kane mere kide ere yenga i, nomanen podo paugo, ene mudu ere yenga. Ene taragl ere yenga i, uglo koglo koglo kau si meglmiwa.<verse eid="PSA 104:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104" />
</usx>